    "description": "The Rideshare ETA Retrieval API facilitates the retrieval of estimated time of arrival (ETA) for rideshare rides. This API enables applications to access real-time data on ride ETAs for various routes, enhancing user experience by providing timely updates. Typical consumers include rideshare platforms, mobile applications, and logistics services that require accurate ride information to improve operational efficiency. By leveraging this API, developers can seamlessly integrate ETA features into their applications, increasing customer satisfaction and streamlining ride management.",
    "version": "1.0"
  },
